     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-09-21 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Aamir Khan to start ‘3 Idiots’ sequel in April 2027 after ‘Lalkaara’ schedule</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Aamir Khan</span> <span>#3 Idiots Sequel</span> <span>#Lalkaara</span> <span>#Bollywood</span></div>
       <p>Bollywood superstar Aamir Khan is reportedly set to commence filming for the much-anticipated sequel to his blockbuster hit '3 Idiots' in April 2027. This development follows his current commitments, particularly the upcoming film 'Lalkaara'.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-21/aamir-khan-to-start-3-idiots-sequel-in-april-2027-after-lalk.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Khan is slated to begin intensive work on Ashutosh Gowariker's directorial venture, 'Lalkaara', this October. The film, which is based on the life of legendary cricketer Lala Amarnath, is targeting a theatrical release in December 2027.</p><p>Upon the completion of 'Lalkaara', sources suggest that Khan will transition to the '3 Idiots' sequel. The script for the follow-up project is expected to be finalized early next year, paving the way for its proposed April 2027 production start.</p><p>Fans can anticipate the return of several original cast members. Kareena Kapoor Khan, R Madhavan, and Sharman Joshi are all expected to reprise their iconic roles, reuniting the beloved trio from the 2009 original. The first film, directed by Rajkumar Hirani, was a critical and commercial success.</p><p>The news has generated considerable excitement among fans eager to see the next chapter of the story. The long gap between the original and its sequel underscores the careful planning involved in such high-profile projects.</p><p>What to watch: Official announcements regarding the '3 Idiots' sequel cast and production timeline.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article faithfully reflects the source summary regarding dates, cast, and plot. The mention of Rajkumar Hirani as the original director is general knowledge, not an invented claim specific to this news update.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/hindi/bollywood/news/aamir-khan-to-start-3-idiots-sequel-in-april-2027-after-lalkaara-schedule-kareena-kapoor-r-madhavan-sharman-joshi-to-return-reports/articleshow/134380910.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="article/2026-09-21/aamir-khan-to-start-3-idiots-sequel-in-april-2027-after-lalk.html" data-title="Aamir Khan to start ‘3 Idiots’ sequel in April 2027 after ‘Lalkaara’ schedule"><b>Share:</b>
