      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/flash-floods-in-keralams-nilambur-five-bodies-recovered-search-on-for-missing-woman/article71490206.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
